  "statement": "Chains in one crystal are not independent experimental replicates, and crystal packing can affect each of them. The within-entry crystal-copy variation is a descriptive range of differences among the chains the user selected. It is not a calibrated noise floor, not a statistical uncertainty, not a nucleotide or ligand effect and not an HDX replicate estimate. An advisory flag appears only for a channel whose minimum difference the user configured; it is an advisory rule, not a gate, not an adequacy verdict, not significance and not biological separation."
